  "content_type": "paragraph",
  "content_text": "Bug Review\nWe released our project on November 2nd.\n[11 月 2 日，我们发布了我们项目。]\nBut we didn’t do a proper post-check, so the issue wasn’t found until the 4th, when the user reported an incident.\n[但是由于没有做好 post check ，导致直到 4 号被 user 发现并发出了 incident]\nDuring the root cause analysis, we also made some mistakes due to several reasons, and we missed the time window to fix it.\n[在分析 route couse 的时候也因为各种原因导致分析错误，以至于错过了再次上线修复的时间窗口。]\nIn the end, we had to take a not-so-compliant way to make up for the whole issue.\n[最后只能采取一种不太合规的方式弥补这一系列的事故。]",
