          "language": "en"
        },
        {
          "text": "11 月 2 日，我们发布了我们项目。",
          "start_time": 1.224,
          "end_time": 4.008,
          "language": "source"
        },
        {
          "text": "\n",
          "start_time": 22.416,
          "end_time": 22.416,
          "language": "en"
        },
        {
          "text": "But we didn’t do a proper post-check, so the issue wasn’t found until the 4th, when the user reported an incident.",
          "start_time": 4.008,
