          "start_time": 22.416,
          "end_time": 22.416,
          "language": "en"
        },
        {
          "text": "但是由于没有做好 post check ，导致直到 4 号被 user 发现并发出了 incident",
          "start_time": 4.008,
          "end_time": 10.704,
          "language": "source"
        },
        {
          "text": "\n",
          "start_time": 22.416,
          "end_time": 22.416,
          "language": "en"
        },
        {
          "text": "During the root cause analysis, we also made some mistakes due to several reasons, and we missed the time window to fix it.",
          "start_time": 10.704,
          "end_time": 17.376,
          "language": "en"
        },
        {
